From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 19:21:24 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 13/72] flashnext: bind the compute lane in its family, boot it
 on the CUDA host

Flash-Next's binding (generic TF_COMPUTE_LANE*, the python tool) moves from
core/compute_binding.zig to families/flashnext/compute_binding.zig and the
family Namespace declares it as compute. The generic CUDA host sets
Info.compute and Info.compute_tool for any family that declares compute.
DeepSeek-V4.1's binding and tests are unchanged.

Flattened from a merge of a side branch holding only this commit; the merge's diff against its
first parent is this commit's diff.
